    {
      "id": "auth",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Autenticación\n`lib/features/auth/data/auth_service.dart`\nFirebase Auth; invitado separado de cuentas.",
      "x": -690,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 290,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "main",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Arranque\n`lib/main.dart`\n`AccountSessionGate`: restaura por cuenta antes de montar rutas. Recupera cierres pendientes.",
      "x": -690,
      "y": -210,
      "width": 290,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "repository",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Fachada de datos\n`lib/core/data/repositories.dart`\nFitnessRepository combina almacenamiento, sincronización y estadísticas.",
      "x": -690,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 290,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "local",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Persistencia local\n`lib/core/data/account_storage_scope.dart`\nHive y preferencias de entrenamiento por cuenta; invitado conserva nombres anteriores.",
      "x": -690,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 290,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "entities",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Entidades compartidas\n`lib/core/domain/entities.dart`\nEntrenamiento, comida, sueño, preferencias.",
      "x": -690,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 290,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "remote",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Sincronización\n`lib/core/data/remote_sync_service.dart`\nCola/políticas/pull/push Firestore.",
      "x": -345,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 290,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "stats",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Estadísticas\n`lib/core/data/statistics_service.dart`\nAgregaciones reutilizadas por Home y Analytics.",
      "x": -345,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 290,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "health",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Integraciones de salud\n`lib/core/integrations/fitness_integration_manager.dart`\nHealthKit, Google Fit, Fitbit → repositorio.",
      "x": -345,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 290,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "shell",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Navegación principal\n`lib/features/navigation/main_shell.dart`\nInicio, Hábitos, acción central, Grupos y Perfil.",
      "x": -320,
      "y": -210,
      "width": 315,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "home",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Home\n`lib/features/home/presentation/home_summary_screen.dart`\nResumen; utilidades en `home/domain/`.",
      "x": 80,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "habits",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hábitos\n`lib/features/habits/presentation/habits_tracker_screen.dart`\nModelos/galería en `habits/domain/`.",
      "x": 80,
      "y": -230,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "groups",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Grupos\n`lib/features/groups/presentation/pages/groups_list_screen.dart`\nServicio/modelo en `groups/domain/`.",
      "x": 80,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Perfil\n`lib/features/profile/profile_social_screen.dart`\nAjustes relacionados en `features/settings/`.",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "workout",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Entrenamiento\n`lib/features/workout/`\nRutinas: borrador único → planes → resultados.\nÍndice: CODEBASE_MAP.md\nPlan: docs/plans/ROUTINE_SYSTEM_2026_10_12.md",
      "x": 500,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "nutrition",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Nutrición\n`lib/features/nutrition/presentation/nutrition_home_screen.dart`\nRepositorio, FDC y catálogo en `nutrition/data/`.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Sueño\n`lib/features/sleep/presentation/sleep_overview_screen.dart`\nInsights y tiempo en `sleep/domain/`.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "analytics",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Analytics\n`lib/features/analytics/analytics_overview_screen.dart`\nConsume métricas agregadas.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "settings",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Ajustes\n`lib/features/settings/settings_screen.dart`\nPreferencias persistidas en `core/data/app_preferences.dart`.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "exercise",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Biblioteca de ejercicios\n`lib/features/workout/pro/data/exercise_library.dart`\n297 IDs; 6 imágenes específicas, 291 genéricas.\nCobertura: docs/design/EXERCISE_ART_MANIFEST.json",
      "x": 920,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalog",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Catálogo nutricional\n`lib/features/nutrition/data/offline_food_catalog.dart`\nAsset USDA: `assets/data/usda_foundation_2026_04.json`.",
      "x": 920,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "fdc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Fuente FDC\n`lib/features/nutrition/data/fdc_client.dart`\nProxy/clave según plataforma. Ver INTEGRATIONS.",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ui",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Tema y diseño\n`lib/app/theme/app_theme.dart`\n`lib/features/common/theme/app_colors.dart`\nNorma visual: `docs/design/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`.",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "tests",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Pruebas y CI\n`test/features/` por área; `test/training_home_screen_test.dart`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml`. Ejecutar primero la prueba focal.",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
